    "name": "Breaking Point Iris Rhizome",
    "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">The Breaking Point iris is&nbsp;a tall bearded iris (TB) known for its striking, broken color pattern and ability to rebloom.&nbsp;It features cream-colored standards with tan veins, and violet falls with white splashes.&nbsp;The beards are old gold, ending in violet petals touched with white streaks.&nbsp;This iris also boasts a wide form with 9 buds on well-spaced stalks and is known for its consistent mid-fall rebloom.&nbsp;</span></p>",
